          "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 22 2022 22:16:19 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">T2 Humeral Nailing System</span><br>\n </span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Product features&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Retrograde vs. antegrade target device</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">6mm of active internal compression</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Sizes range from 7-9mm</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">4mm proximal/distal locking screws</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Static, dynamic and advances locking</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Apposition/compression locking</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Dec 14 2022 02:03:18 GMT+0000",
